          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Looking to bring warmth, energy, and bold color into your space? Our vibrant red candles do just that — instantly. They’re the go-to choice for creating mood, enhancing ambiance, or simply adding a touch of sophisticated drama to any setting. From romantic dinners to festive gatherings, a glowing red candle brings emotion and elegance to the table.</p><p>Available in various sizes and styles, our red candles are crafted for a clean, dripless burn that keeps your setup looking polished from start to finish. No messy wax, no overpowering scent — just pure, steady light. Ready to refresh your decor? Browse our collection and bring a deeper glow into your home.<br/><br/></p>",
